<description>&lt;p&gt;Journalist Tomás Beltrán was murdered outside his home and two local election candidates were shot dead in El Oro, while a priest died when a crucifix fell during mass, showing continued attacks on public figures in Ecuador. These killings occur amid ongoing campaign violence noted in a November 2026 risk report. The security crisis stems from criminal organizations linked to drug trafficking that have been active since 2018. The UCDP counted 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFBaR2NJSnEtNGdGS05uaU94T05ULXIyQW4yYXdzYnpZMWdGOTU5b1JnSEhfdWNNRjBlNkxwNVZhLXI3aWktSlVkeHlvQ2p3Skg3UUlLLW9HTkd3c2s?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE1oRXRQUF95bHFfeW1jM1E2dDhOMnMwWWRuRGxVMGp3dElscUxDTGR3aENpNEFOOHFWWGFiQm5PT1BDSko5Smk3SFE1NVN4a3hnMTZXdU9zQzZ4ZHEwak5XYXFIcXhXWFVsVExPWHJERDZNQlNZMHBqcmlIZUg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOcXl3c1dYOXh2WW5RSFZ0MjZqcHdSNHdwOFk2Y1Rob0JLZVp1S3NTY3hKbHFkaTFISnhyMWZ6YVE5MXZieVJ3ZC15YWlhWks5MnZiOWpFNnRSb1lvNExaUmdoVWFFMVR4VWdLc1E2d2o3RjFrMC1JaDA3LXhjQURwNU96b1pjSFU4cU5vWl9ybVNEb3N2?oc=5&quot;&gt;CTPost&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxNUmRzTU94V0k1Z1gzT2RJVXFlUEhkWFIzckFrUzFLQ1k1NGZhanlfcXA5b3Nid1VxV053VXBhajl4NEIxU2tzeWg1NG03WEFXcklWMHQyQjcxazhiRmpkUnptV25CQ2tWZ1NvUS1FTndxa1AtWkw0YXVxRFBaOVFaZzhSM1V6eHVBb3EteV83aHJNS0daVWQ0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Drop Site News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE1EcDlLdi1tcG56a1NVaWJXYkQ4dFg5Rms4LWlILVdxYW1FdFNJQ0Y0N21aWTNHRjlTdHB3U2J5dU9YSGxBZ0VqRGtkTmFVVkI5anhNWC1mM0FZV1QyYUtBdEJQbVppV3JOTS1xbnd6Y1JNZ05kUzkyaVMyaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latin Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a h